    course_description = '<h4>Course overview</h4><p>This year-long program can transform your interest in research into a deeper understanding and appreciation of Indigenous knowledge and culture. With the guidance of an expert supervisor, you’ll select a topic, develop your thesis and engage in research that speaks to your passion as well as to a broader and deeper cultural importance. While advancing your analytic, writing and research skills, you will also open the way to more diverse career options, or even further study towards a doctorate. Best of all, completion of this degree will see your research contribute new knowledge and perspective of Indigenous life and culture.</p>',
